<title>GERMANY: AVA sees 97 earnings at last year's level.</title>
<headline>AVA sees 97 earnings at last year's level.</headline>
<dateline>BIELEFELD, Germany 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>German retailer AVA AG said on Thursday that it expected its 1997 profits to reach 1996 levels.</p>
<p>In a mandatory bourse statement, AVA said that its 1997 earnings forecast had already taken into account 56 million marks costs associated with a change in owenership.</p>
<p>AVA posted a net profit of 28.6 million marks in 1996 and 10.5 million marks in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
